  description: A magical aquatic being that lives in the oceans of Grand Gaia. They
    are often found in the tales of humans. They usually live in the sea or on the
    shore, but they are found anywhere where there is water, including rivers and
    lakes. A human can easily run into one. They move in groups and are observed
    to be very dangerous when hunting larger beasts.
